# This repository tracks the *extracted* contents of the pack, so most binary
# formats here (.vtex, .vmat, .vmdl, .dmx, .vpcf, .png) are deliberately
# committed. Only build output, scratch space and local tooling belong below.

# --- Release artifacts -------------------------------------------------------
# The packed VPK is a release artifact, not source. Fourteen of them were
# committed and later deleted before the repo switched to tracking the extracted
# tree; keep it that way.
*.vpk
pak01_dir.vpk

# Archives people produce while packaging or downloading upstream mods
*.7z
*.zip
*.rar

# --- Compiled Panorama -------------------------------------------------------
# Source 2 compile output: *.vxml_c, *.vcss_c, *.vjs_c, *.vtex_c and friends.
# The repo stores the decompiled sources instead. (Plain .vtex without the _c
# suffix IS tracked -- that is a shipped texture, not compile output.)
*_c

# --- Scratch space -----------------------------------------------------------
# Where decompilers and packing tools get pointed. Never source.
/decompiled/
/extracted/
/build/
/dist/
/tmp/
/_scratch/

# --- Tooling -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# --- Editors and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
